WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.740
What's going on today?

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.700
The presidential nomination is happening in the city today, isn't it?

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.450
It's a big thing that's got nothing to do with us, huh?

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:26.210
Excuse me.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.710
Keep up the good work.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.850
Hey, Daches.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.180
Chief.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.430
The FBI's terrorism expert himself, huh?

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.940
I'm glad to see you're taking command of security yourself, Chief.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:51.860
The nomination convention for the presidential candidates is tomorrow, after all.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.990
If you have a gun on you, please give it to us.

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:01.410
We'll return it to you when you leave the city.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.660
No, I don't have one.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.840
Hey.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.890
Isn't this a handgun?

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:22.810
No.

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:23.600
It's a toy.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:24.230
A toy?

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.230
Plastic?

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:29.230
It's pretty well made.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:31.190
Is it a handgun?

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.740
No, it's a toy.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.650
We'll send it to headquarters and then return it to you.

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:38.950
This is the paper you'll need to get it back.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.990
Come get it tomorrow morning.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:43.370
Okay, you can go.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:02:03.560
He's hesitant as to whether he can get the food and leave before the cage shuts.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.980
This next job may put you in the same position as that cat.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:18.740
But you are a man who makes the impossible possible.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.990
Will you accept it, Golgo 13?

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:47.270
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:58.610
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:10.370
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:16.670
The weak person I was is no more

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:22.260
I decided to just believe

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:29.390
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:33.230
I go towards you

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:40.950
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:45.070
I go towards you

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:49.120
Blown by the wind

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:54.580
Oh blown

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:00.670
An Offering to God

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:06.930
Mr. Tougou.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.100
Sorry for the trouble.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:19.570
There was no real need to confiscate a toy, but as you can see, it's the eve of the convention.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.210
Oh, Daches.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:36.710
It's been a while.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.420
Follow that Asian guy.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.550
If you have a chance, check what he's carrying.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:42.720
Understood.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.180
What is he doing here?

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.640
He came here to get something that was confiscated. It was just a toy handgun, though.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:50.520
A toy handgun?

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:55.520
Yeah, made of plastic. No problem at all.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.730
I'm not laughing.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.240
If my memory serves me right,

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.990
I wouldn't want him carrying so much as a goddamn knitting needle.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.430
Yes, he's not doing anything special.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:33.930
Thomas is checking his car now.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.600
Is it okay?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:39.940
If you're not careful, won't he notice that we're watching him?

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.150
Don't worry.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:48.950
We'll take two or three things from his car to make it look like a crime.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:52.870
Whatever he's after is at the convention.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.450
He's not trying to move.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.420
Understood.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:05:59.710
I'll be right there.

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:08.380
Give me a break, sir.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:11.260
That many hits and I'll be out of business!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:14.520
I'll give you the first prize, so would you just go?

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:26.490
There wasn't anything resembling a weapon in his car.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.650
Just a plastic toy.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.820
You stole something, right?

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:33.240
Yeah, it's pretty nice stuff.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:03.650
What's wrong?

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.980
It was just an automotive break in.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.150
What was lost?

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.530
A lighter, sunglasses, and a toy.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.160
A toy?

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:15.660
Yeah. He said it was a plastic handgun.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:20.120
That's strange. I only took the lighter and the sunglasses.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.270
It's him!

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.290
Let's go.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.880
If he does something even the slightest bit odd, arrest him.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.800
Yes, sir.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.660
U-Um...

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:47.920
Damn!

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:31.090
What?

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.550
You lost him?

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.420
I'm sorry.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.260
Find him right now.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:38.010
Seal off all the exits.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.180
Cage him inside!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:41.510
Yes, sir!

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:48.440
The instant he does something here, he'll no longer be able to leave.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:51.360
He'll be a beast trapped inside a cage.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.480
I won't let him get away!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.110
The votes have been tallied!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.450
Now to announce the winner!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.120
The target is this man.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:16.630
One of his objectives is to reduce the power of our organization.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:20.220
If the candidate he supports becomes president,

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:26.480
he'll be in a position to fight against us as a special aide.

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:33.440
Furthermore, taking him out is a warning to his master.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.480
"Don't mess with us."

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:40.200
That's why I want you to kill him in front of the candidate.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:15.730
We've been had!

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.860
All security, we've had an incident!

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:25.370
Don't let a single person get away from the convention grounds!

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:27.870
Don't let a single living thing out!

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:27.870
Seal all the exits, now!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.090
He's completely inside the cage.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:42.590
I won't let him get away!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:10.120
Looks like the picture made it in time, but...

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:14.120
He's the famous sniper, Golgo 13, isn't he?

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:14.960
Yes.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:18.420
But how did he get the gun inside?

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:21.170
He passed a metal detector and a patdown.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:24.180
We'll find something if we catch him.

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.680
Just arrest him.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.220
Isn't that impossible?

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.680
First, we should designate him as a person of interest...

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.890
Leave it to me.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.190
I'll catch him red-handed!

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:41.030
It's him!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.190
Golgo 13...

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:15.020
Arrest him for obstruction of the duties of a public official and assault.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.780
Is he Golgo 13?

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.820
He is.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:31.080
The legendary sniper with superhuman sniping powers, Golgo 13.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.750
Do you have any proof that he's the criminal?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:40.750
Most likely, the criminal shot from the scoreboard behind the stage.

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.590
The scoreboard?

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.260
That's impossible.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.510
No matter how good the sniper, that's too far.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:49.260
That's why we know he's the sniper.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:55.020
From his past data, a shot like that is nothing.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:14:02.480
These conditions, nearly impossible for a normal human, show that it was him.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:07.990
Now then, why don't you give us your alibi for the time of the crime.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.490
You were hiding in the scoreboard, so you can't answer that.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.500
How long can you remain silent, I wonder?

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.090
His jacket tested positive for gunpowder residue.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:22.960
I see...

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:26.420
The difficult sniping conditions, the lack of an alibi...

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:28.430
And now, the gunpowder residue.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:32.550
We're one step closer to a conviction.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.140
Daches, what about the motive?

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.730
He's a pro.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.850
An alibi means nothing.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:44.360
I'll look into his background, but we can do that later.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.280
All that's left is finding the gun.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.650
If we can find that...

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.080
What? What did you say?

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:02.750
Call a lawyer.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.630
A lawyer?

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:13.260
I see, fine, we'll get you a lawyer.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:17.270
In this country, you're free to ask for a lawyer when you think it's going badly for you.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.770
You haven't found the weapon?

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:26.400
No.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:30.450
We haven't found a single knife, let alone a handgun.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.530
That's impossible.

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:34.160
Daches, a moment.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:38.830
Even a toy gun can shoot a real bullet?

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:43.330
Yes. I thought it was just plastic, so I didn't really check it,

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:45.790
but if it was PPS Polymer, it's possible.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.380
PPS Polymer?

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.840
A heat-resistant plastic.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.550
Multiple shots will cause it to change shape due to the heat of the gunpowder,

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:55.430
but accurate sniping is possible for the first shot.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.560
One shot is enough for him.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:02.980
But we've had no reports that a toy gun was found...

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:06.020
He could melt or destroy the plastic!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:10.400
Send the forensics team back to the convention grounds

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:14.030
and have them find all the plastic there, not just guns.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.330
A plastic handgun.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.750
You're pretty smart, huh?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:28.340
But it's only a matter of time until it's found.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:33.510
Agent. The lawyer, Mr. Barton, is here.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.430
I'm Terry Barton.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:39.850
Nice to meet you.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:48.940
You still haven't found it?

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.030
We haven't.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:56.370
If such a thorough search fails to turn up anything, the gun probably isn't there anymore.

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:58.620
That's impossible.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.040
He called for a lawyer.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:03.370
That has to be because he's sure the gun will be found.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.750
Have them check again!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.880
But we've already...

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:09.250
Excuse me.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:14.260
I'd like to talk to you in the stead of my client.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:27.770
You see, my client is very sorry that he acted violently.

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:29.270
Violently?

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:34.280
He's here for assault and obstruction of a public official's duties, yes?

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:37.280
That's true, that's why he's here.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:42.790
How about it... Why don't you let him off with a fine?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.330
Don't be stupid!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.830
A fine?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.000
Who the fuck do you think I am?

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:51.800
If you insist on prosecuting,

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:56.510
we'll be left with no choice but to proceed with a human rights violation complaint...

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.510
Human rights violation?

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:04.520
Yes, in regards to the murder you've accused my client of.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.270
He had nothing to do with it.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.270
What?

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:11.360
I won't let you get away with that.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:13.280
Your jacket even tested positive for gunpowder!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.740
Mr. Daches,

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.860
are you aware that before he went to the convention grounds,

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.660
he played a shooting game at an amusement park?

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:22.280
A shooting game?

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:24.790
Did he?

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:25.660
Well, he...

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:28.500
I'm told that the shooting gallery didn't get many customers,

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.170
so it's likely that the owner remembers him.

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:32.920
Answer me!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.840
Did you see him play a shooting game?

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.300
Y-Yes.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:39.680
I thought he was killing time, so I didn't report it.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:44.100
I'm told that they still use gunpowder there.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:47.480
There's no mystery, then, as to why his jacket tested positive for gunpowder.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.690
And regarding the matter of his alibi,

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:57.780
who would be paying attention to the people around them in such an excited atmosphere?

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:04.490
Why don't you bring a random person who was at the convention and ask them to prove <i>their</i> alibi.

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:09.080
I'm sure the vast majority would be unable to name someone else who saw them.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.210
Am I wrong?

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:15.000
And you have no weapon.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:19.550
A strict patdown is required to enter the convention grounds, yes?

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:21.550
There was even a metal detector.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:25.970
My client made it through without an issue, didn't he?

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:31.940
The gun didn't have to be metal, it could have been plastic.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:38.940
If it was made from a type of plastic called PPS, it's possible for it to fire a single bullet.

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:44.280
Did you find that gun?

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:49.960
Are you saying that it was identified as the murder weapon, and his fingerprints were found on it?

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:53.420
We'll find it soon!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:57.460
We know he had a toy handgun.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:01.380
It's true, he had a toy gun.

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:06.470
But he says that it was stolen from his car, along with his sunglasses and lighter.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:08.100
What?

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:12.890
He reported this to the police.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.810
I'm sure you have a record of it, take a look!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.110
That's a lie!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:22.400
All I took from that car were the sunglasses and a lighter!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.950
I didn't take any toy handgun-

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:24.820
Thomas!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:30.200
Oh, so you've been stealing from my client as well?

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:33.830
This is going to go beyond a human rights complaint, I imagine.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:42.510
Let him go, Daches.

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:45.340
We'll never convince a judge with this.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:48.050
Wait, Chief.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:52.060
We'll search the convention grounds again tomorrow and find the gun!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:56.770
You're wasting your time, you've already looked everywhere.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:01.070
Even if it was light plastic, do you think it flew away into the sky?

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.240
The sky?

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.320
<i>The sky?</i>

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.950
I get it!

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:05.610
The balloons!

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:13.080
He tied the gun to a balloon and sent it aloft!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.080
What?

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:19.710
Chief, contact the air force, quickly!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.090
Don't be stupid.

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:22.590
And the sun's already set.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:24.340
Then tomorrow morning.

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:29.600
It will be beyond our reach by then.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.850
Damn it.

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.690
In that case, can I take my client home?

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.230
Impressive.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.860
You had it all planned out?

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:49.870
You called a lawyer to make me think you'd given up,

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:53.870
and to keep me from thinking about the balloons, didn't you?

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.870
Didn't you, Golgo 13?

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:10.930
So the murder weapon was given to God?

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:49.680
Chiisana koto ni zenryoku ni naru kimi no sugata yuuki ni natta hibi

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:49.680
Those days I saw you giving your all for small things filled me with courage

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:57.140
Zutto horyuu shippanashi jya ugokenai

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:57.140
If I keep them suspended then I won't be able to move

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.690
GARASU no HAIWEI ni tatteiru you ni

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.690
It's like I'm standing on a glass highway

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.910
Yume to kiken to senaka awase demo

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.910
Even if I'm standing back to back with dreams and danger

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:21.040
Kono nagai michi wo sukoshizutsu arukou

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:21.040
I'll take this long road one step at a time

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:27.210
Soshite kimi wa ano koro mitai ni

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:27.210
And I need you to smile

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:30.220
Waratteite

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:30.220
Like you did back then

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:36.850
Shiokaze ni yurete sasayakiatta

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:36.850
It shook in the sea breeze and whispered

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:47.440
Kagayaiteita tooi ano hi wa kagerou

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:47.440
That distant and shining day is a shimmering haze

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:49.320
The shining days

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:55.280
Tsumaranai koto ni makeru ni wa hayasugiru

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:55.280
I can't lose to something so trivial

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:07.170
The target is a single violin string during the middle of a performance.

00:24:07.170 --> 00:24:13.640
Golgo analyzes footage of the soloist Kerinsky, and takes aim.

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:20.430
When an Aria in G is played,
the trigger of an M-16 is pulled.

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:22.520
Next time on Golgo 13:

00:24:21.180 --> 00:24:27.020
A Shot in G

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:24.810
A Shot in G.

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:28.940
Don't stand behind him if you value your life.
